✅ 1. Install Tailwind CSS (with Vite or Create React App)
If you're using Vite (recommended for speed):

bash
Copy
Edit
npm create vite@latest frontend --template react
cd frontend
npm install
Then install Tailwind CSS:

bash
Copy
Edit
npm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
Configure Tailwind in tailwind.config.js:

js
Copy
Edit
// tailwind.config.js
export default {
  content: ["./index.html", "./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}"],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
};
Add Tailwind to src/index.css:

css
Copy
Edit
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
✅ 2. Install Recharts
bash
Copy
Edit
npm install recharts
✅ 3. (Optional) Install Toast Notifications
bash
Copy
Edit
npm install react-toastify
Use it like:

js
Copy
Edit
import { toast } from 'react-toastify';
toast("Drift detected!");
